<title>HONG KONG: C.Lyonnais sets call warrants on Swire.</title>
<headline>C.Lyonnais sets call warrants on Swire.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Lyonnais Financial Products (Guernsey) Ltd said on Wednesday it has issued 80 million American-style call warrants on Swire Pacific Ltd &quot;A&quot; shares.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    HK$61.25	PREMIUM	    16 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     HK$0.98	 GEARING	    6.25X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	26.MAR.98     PAYDATE	    14.APR.97</p>
<p> REFERENCE PRICE HK$61.25	LISTING DATE     16.APR.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   HONG KONG     MIN EXER LOT     5,000</p>
<p> NOTES	     CASH OR PHYSICAL DELIVERY AT ISSUER'S</p>
<p>		     DISCRETION.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
